[2.110417,"o","   or: busybox --install [-s] [DIR]\n"]
[2.110435,"o","   or: function [arguments]...\n"]
[2.110452,"o","\n"]
[2.110468,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[2.110485,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[2.110502,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[2.110518,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
