[72.457662,"o","\n"]
[72.457679,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[72.457696,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[72.457712,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
