[89.28413,"o","\n"]
[89.284148,"o","    BusyBox is a multi-call binary that combines many common Unix\n"]
[89.284166,"o","    utilities into a single executable.  Most people will create a\n"]
[89.284184,"o","    link to busybox for each function they wish to use and BusyBox\n"]
[89.284201,"o","    will act like whatever it was invoked as.\n"]
[89.284219,"o","\n"]
